  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support  for procurement and provision of essential medicines and malaria commodities to reduce child mortality  in Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support  for procurement and provision of essential medicines and malaria commodities to reduce child mortality  in Zambia is a component of Malaria and Child Health Programme 2011 - 2015 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 112 - Other bilateral donor and a budget of &#xa3;25,036,250. It works in the following sector(s): Malaria control, Basic health care, Reproductive health care.</narrative>
  </description>
